      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am currently having to apply constraints to the eyelids to simulate what it is supposed to be doing, and manually making blinking animations. This is more work than I feel is necessary for something that should be as simple as applying the blinking like people normally would with blend shapes.\n\nBut as you know, Quest does not support constraints so this is a massive issue for someone trying to make avatars for both platforms.",
